      <div>
        <h4>What is the average cost of a roof replacement in Tampa Bay?</h4>
        <p>The average cost ranges from $8,000 to $15,000, depending on materials, labor, and roof size.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Does the season affect roofing prices in Florida?</h4>
